{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseHostHeader\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseHostHeader</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">config</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config\">Config</a> := <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">{</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">}</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Internal/Parsec/ByteArray.html#Std.Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser\">Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser</a> (<a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Host\">Host</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URI.Port\">Port</a>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses an HTTP `Host` header value.\n","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseHostHeader","kind":"def","line":460,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseHostHeader","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.lean#L460-L483"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseURIReference\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseURIReference</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">config</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config\">Config</a> := <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">{</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">}</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Internal/Parsec/ByteArray.html#Std.Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser\">Internal.Parsec.ByteArray.Parser</a> <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Basic.html#Std.Http.URIReference\">URIReference</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses a URI reference as defined in RFC 3986 Section 4.1:\n\n```\nURI-reference = URI / relative-ref\nrelative-ref  = relative-part [ \"?\" query ] [ \"#\" fragment ]\nrelative-part = \"//\" authority path-abempty\n              / path-absolute\n              / path-noscheme\n              / path-empty\n```\n\nTries a full URI first (requires a scheme). Falls back to a relative reference: authority-rooted\n(`//host/path`), absolute-path (`/path`), path-noscheme (`foo/bar`, `../baz`), query-only\n(`?q`), fragment-only (`#frag`), or empty.\n","docLink":"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseURIReference","kind":"def","line":406,"name":"Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseURIReference","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.lean#L406-L458"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Parser.html#Std.Http.URI.Parser.parseRequestTarget\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Http</span>.<span class=\"name\">URI</span>.<span class=\"name\">Parser</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseRequestTarget</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">config</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config\">Config</a> := <a href=\"./Std/Http/Data/URI/Config.html#Std.Http.URI.Config.mk\">{</a> <a h